```
[HIGH] Database URL constructed with undefined password, producing invalid connection string
File: /Users/robinsonchan/seatsniper/src/config/index.ts:79
```

`DB_PASSWORD` is optional and defaults to `undefined`. The constructed URL becomes `postgresql://seatsniper:undefined@localhost:5432/seatsniper` which will fail to connect with a misleading password error.

```typescript
// CURRENT:
url: env.DATABASE_URL || `postgresql://${env.DB_USER}:${env.DB_PASSWORD}@${env.DB_HOST}:${env.DB_PORT}/${env.DB_NAME}`,

// FIX:
url: env.DATABASE_URL || (env.DB_PASSWORD
  ? `postgresql://${env.DB_USER}:${env.DB_PASSWORD}@${env.DB_HOST}:${env.DB_PORT}/${env.DB_NAME}`
  : `postgresql://${env.DB_USER}@${env.DB_HOST}:${env.DB_PORT}/${env.DB_NAME}`),
```

