```
[HIGH] URL cache grows unbounded -- only evicts one entry when limit is hit
File: /Users/robinsonchan/seatsniper/src/venues/seat-map.service.ts:420-424
```

The cache at line 420 removes only one entry when size exceeds 50, then adds a new one. With rapid polling of different seat map URLs, the cache hovers at 50-51 entries, each containing a ~100-300 KB Buffer, consuming ~15 MB. But more importantly, the eviction strategy only removes the first inserted key, which may not be the least recently used. Over time, frequently accessed seat maps can get evicted while stale ones remain.

```typescript
// CURRENT:
